Your classmate: You look really tired today. Did you sleep badly?
You: Yes, I did. {{1}}
Your classmate: I was watching videos on my phone until two in the morning.
You: That’s not good for you. And {{2}}?
Your classmate: Almost every night, to be honest. I can’t stop scrolling.
You: I read an article about it. {{3}}
Your classmate: Really? I didn’t know the light from the screen was a problem.
You: Yes, it is. {{4}}
Your classmate: That’s a good idea, but my phone is also my alarm clock.
You: Then why {{5}}?
Your classmate: Good question. I’ll buy a cheap one this weekend and try it.
Your classmate: Thanks for the advice. I’ll tell you how it goes.
You: {{6}}
